  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Gaia** (1 review): Extended drum solo and added percussion distinguish this performance from other 2022 shows [2]\n- **Magenta Mountain** (1 review): Final forty minutes feature dense jams including Ice V, Lava, and Dripping Tap [2]\n- **Lava** (1 review): The performance of Lava is described as being nailed [3]\n- **The Dripping Tap** (1 review): The song is condensed to just the right length [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Fourth Color**: rare: 4 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-10-29** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 104 min; rated 4.67/5 by 3 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The set from Crumbling Castle onwards is highlighted as exceptionally strong [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-10-29**: taped by Brian Cox; transferred by Brian Cox; source: AT4051 > Zoom F8 [1]",
